WEBVTT

NOTE English captions for https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MK5q_zMiX1g, from YouTube, repeats removed.

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.240
This is a longer dua, but it's beautiful.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.428
The Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam when he would go to the morning prayer.

00:00:05.428 --> 00:00:08.536
See, real quick, how do you get light on the Day of Judgment?

00:00:08.536 --> 00:00:11.914
The worships that you do in the darkness of dunya give you light on Day of

00:00:11.914 --> 00:00:15.227
Judgment. The Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam said, "When you walk to Fajr prayer, it's dark out.

00:00:15.227 --> 00:00:16.800
That's light on the Day of Judgment.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.960
When you walk to Isha prayer, it's dark out.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.832
That's light on the Day of Judgment.

00:00:20.832 --> 00:00:24.780
Anything done in that darkness for God is light on the Day of Judgment."

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.743
So, on his way walking to the morning prayer, he used to say this dua.

00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:30.200
Allahumma ja'alli nuran fi qalbi.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.657
Write some of this down.

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:34.220
If you don't get the whole thing, write some of it.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.126
"Oh Allah, place my light in my heart.

00:00:36.126 --> 00:00:37.591
Waj'alli nuran fi sam'i.

00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:40.520
Oh Allah, place light in how I listen.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.914
Waj'alli nuran fi basari.

00:00:41.914 --> 00:00:45.400
Oh Allah, place light in how I look at things.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.660
Waj'alli nuran an yamini.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.180
Oh Allah, put light on my right side.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.328
Wa an yasari, on my right side.

00:00:51.328 --> 00:00:53.696
Waj'alli nuran min bayni yadayya wa min khalfi.

00:00:53.696 --> 00:00:55.365
Put nur in front of me.

00:00:55.365 --> 00:00:56.335
Put nur behind me.

00:00:56.335 --> 00:00:58.033
Put nur all around me, ya Allah."

00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:03.440
And then the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam, he would say, "Oh Allah, just make me nur.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:09.323
Make me nur." And that brings me to my next point, which is we all have

00:01:09.323 --> 00:01:12.798
to become the light for other people in our lives.

00:01:12.798 --> 00:01:15.520
We cannot be the sources of other people's darkness.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.051
We have to become the light for other people.

00:01:18.051 --> 00:01:20.085
That means we help them to goodness.

00:01:20.085 --> 00:01:21.829
We help them to do khair.

00:01:21.829 --> 00:01:23.358
We help them to know God.

00:01:23.358 --> 00:01:26.628
We help them to whatever will bring light and clarity to their lives.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:29.870
And you have to surround yourself with other people that have light.

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:33.775
Because on my day that I'm feeling down, as long as I got a ace that

00:01:33.775 --> 00:01:37.305
got light, we're good for the day.
